    owl:unionOf ( <https://w3id.org/lmodel/oscal/LocationDataCenterClassEnum#primary> <https://w3id.org/lmodel/oscal/LocationDataCenterClassEnum#alternate> <https://w3id.org/lmodel/oscal/LocationDataCenterClassEnum#peer> <https://w3id.org/lmodel/oscal/LocationDataCenterClassEnum#availability> <https://w3id.org/lmodel/oscal/LocationDataCenterClassEnum#sub> <https://w3id.org/lmodel/oscal/LocationDataCenterClassEnum#fault> <https://w3id.org/lmodel/oscal/LocationDataCenterClassEnum#failure> ) ;
